Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊 SageMaker AI 推出兼容 OpenAI API 的实时推理端点</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI推理模型取得突破，成功反驳离散几何领域Erdős单位距离猜想</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor发布自研模型Composer 2.5，任务执行成本降至1美元以下</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云百炼平台重磅升级，正式接入智谱、MiniMax等第三方顶尖大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a0856b36ce98c3b224c08ece60f8844f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月20日，阿里云宣布大模型服务平台“百炼”正式转型为涵盖全行业主流模型的“AI模型超级市场”。此次升级实现了全栈开放接入，首批引入智谱GLM-5.1、MiniMax M2.7、月之暗面Kimi K2.6、阶跃星辰等大语言模型，以及Pixverse-v6、可灵、Vidu Q3等视觉多模态模型。百炼平台通过底层标准化处理，为开发者提供统一API接口，无需针对不同厂商单独对接，大幅降低研发与维护成本。新增模型已同步上架“千问云”官网，支持一站式采购与部署。结合阿里云“真武”系列AI芯片及超节点服务器，该平台通过算力优化提升了模型推理效率。此举标志着阿里云从单一自研驱动转向生态聚合，通过打破技术锁定，为企业用户提供更灵活的模型选型与集成方案，助力Agentic时代复杂任务处理。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌推出由Gemini 3.5 Flash驱动的智能搜索框并引入AI代理服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/539e7bea4f495653c6b5517908235172.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式对搜索引擎进行深度改革，推出由Gemini 3.5 Flash模型驱动的全新“智能搜索框”，旨在将传统关键词检索升级为对话式交互体验。该搜索框支持长文本及多模态输入，可理解图片、文件与视频，并能结合Gmail、Google Photos等应用数据提供个性化回答。此外，谷歌计划于今年夏季面向Google AI Pro和Ultra订阅用户上线AI代理系统，支持全天候监控网络内容及自动执行任务。尽管该转型显著提升了搜索的上下文理解能力与交互深度，但外界对其在海量请求下的信息准确性与可靠性仍存质疑。此次更新标志着谷歌搜索从单纯的信息检索工具向具备事务处理能力的智能助手转型，将深刻改变用户与搜索引擎的交互范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊 SageMaker AI 推出兼容 OpenAI API 的实时推理端点</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/435e2f7c53c8a98fa89f620dd13e7320.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊 SageMaker AI 正式推出支持 OpenAI 兼容 API 的实时推理端点，用户仅需更改端点 URL，即可通过 OpenAI SDK、LangChain 或 Strands Agents 直接调用模型，无需重写代码或进行 SigV4 封装。该功能通过新增 /openai/v1 路径实现，支持聊天补全请求及流式输出。此更新允许用户在自有 GPU 基础设施上，利用统一的 OpenAI 接口调用包括 Llama、Mistral 在内的多种模型，并支持在同一端点托管多个模型。在认证方面，该方案采用 Bearer Token 机制，SageMaker Python SDK 已内置相关生成工具以简化流程。此举显著降低了企业将现有 AI 应用迁移至 SageMaker 的技术门槛，提升了多模型部署的灵活性与开</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI推理模型取得突破，成功反驳离散几何领域Erdős单位距离猜想</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年5月20日，OpenAI内部推理模型成功推翻了数学家Paul Erdős于1946年提出的“单位距离猜想”，该成果已在arXiv（编号2605.20579v1）公开发布。不同于以往的检索式生成，该模型基于代数数域构造自主发现了新型证明方案，证明了平面点集中单位距离对数超出了此前人类认定的最优上限。该证明过程涉及数百步严密逻辑推导，展现了模型极高的长链推理能力与原创研究潜力。包括Tim Gowers在内的多位知名数学家对该成果给予高度评价，认为其具备发表于《数学年鉴》的学术水准。这一突破标志着AI已从辅助计算工具进化为原创研究伙伴。该研究对理解点集分布规律具有重要意义，其应用价值将辐射至材料科学中的晶体结构优化、通信网络拓扑设计以及生物医学中的蛋白质折叠模拟等领域，预示着AI在解决复杂基础科学难题方面进</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor发布自研模型Composer 2.5，任务执行成本降至1美元以下</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94912c87f0916d804beb9ff7872035f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor正式发布全新自研模型Composer 2.5，标志着其摆脱对Claude的依赖，开启自研技术路线。在性能表现上，Composer 2.5在终端复杂操作测试中得分69.3%，跨语言工程能力测试得分79.8%，性能表现与Claude Opus 4.7基本持平。该模型通过创新的“边干活边挨骂”实时反馈训练机制及自出题逆向分析能力，显著提升了模型响应与训练速度。在商业化层面，Cursor将任务执行成本大幅压低至每次任务不到1美元，相比Claude和GPT系列模型具备极高的性价比优势。此外，马斯克已公开为该模型站台，并与Cursor达成相关收购期权协议。此次发布不仅重塑了Cursor的市场竞争力，也通过大幅降低AI编程门槛，对现有的AI辅助开发行业格局产生直接冲击。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
